BT 1 0 0 1 0 85.5 Tm /F3+0 10.5 Tf 16 TL (Two 4K60 monitors on one Thunderbolt dock, each trained at HBR3 \0014: 64.8 Gbps over a) Tj T* (40 Gbps USB4 link, yet both light up. A DP main link never idles, and stuffing fills whatever) Tj T* (the pixels don't use, so reserving by link rate books the stuffing too. This lightning talk) Tj T* -0.080551 Tw (shows how Bandwidth Allocation mode lets i915/xe reserve only what the mode needs from) Tj T* 0 Tw (the USB4 Connection Manager, and how the DP IN and DP OUT adapters strip and rebuild) Tj T* (the stuffing so only real data crosses the link.) Tj T* ET
